<title>USA: Walden shareholders OK acquisition by UST.</title>
<headline>Walden shareholders OK acquisition by UST.</headline>
<dateline>ACTON, Mass. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walden Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its shareholders had voted to approve the acquisition of the company by UST Corp.</p>
<p>The transaction, which will be accounted for as pooling of interests, is structured as a tax-free exchange of 1.9 shares of UST common for each share of Walden common, Walden said.</p>
<p>The Federal Reserve approved the acquisition on December 2.</p>
</text>
